{
  "id": "section-953",
  "title": "关于“八一”建军节的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-333.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>333)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　“八一”不能改，这是很重要的一天。我们打响了第一枪，为井冈山的斗争揭开了序幕。<br>\n<br>\n　　这个问题是历史问题，历史问题是不容颠倒的。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-332.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-334.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
